+// Extra MSAA sample counts: whether the device's adapter renders and resolves `sampleCount` on its
+// colour and depth formats (1 and 4 always, as WebGPU; 2 and 8 where the backend reports them).
+// Textures, pipelines and render bundles with such a count are valid. Hosts check the macro.
+#define DAWN_NATIVE_EXTRA_SAMPLE_COUNTS 1
